  ('metamask-metamask-buy', 'MetaMask (MetaMask Buy)', 'monetary-access-rails', 'global-on-ramps', 'https://metamask.io', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], '{"description": "MetaMask Buy is a wallet-embedded fiat-to-crypto access layer that allows users to purchase Ethereum assets directly into their self-custody MetaMask wallet by routing transactions through multiple global on-ramp providers.", "extras": {"Access Bottleneck Type": "Partner Availability + Pricing + Regulation (inherited)", "Conversion Control Model": "Partner-Dependent", "Custody of Funds": "None (routes users to third-party on-ramps; assets delivered to self-custody wallet)", "Decentralization Impact": "Strongly increases Ethereum self-custody adoption while relying on centralized on-ramp partners", "Ethereum Support": "Ethereum Mainnet; Ethereum L2s (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon)", "Failure Mode": "On-ramp options unavailable; degraded onboarding UX", "Founded Year": "2016", "Freeze / Denial Capability": "Indirect (via underlying on-ramp providers)", "Geographic Coverage": "Global", "Headquarters / Primary Jurisdiction": "United States (global operations)", "Is Ethereum Required for Core Function?": "Yes (MetaMask is Ethereum-native)", "KYC / AML Requirement": "Mandatory (performed by underlying on-ramp providers)", "Maintaining Organization": "ConsenSys", "Number of Countries Supported": "150+ (approx., via aggregated providers)", "On-Ramp vs Exchange Bias": "Access-First (Wallet-Embedded Aggregation)", "Practitioner Validation Check": "Is this entity’s primary value proposition (for this product) enabling users to get fiat value into Ethereum-native assets? Yes", "Practitioner’s Note": "MetaMask Buy is one of the highest-impact onboarding funnels in Ethereum: it combines self-custody delivery with on-ramp aggregation, but access quality and pricing are inherited from third-party providers rather than controlled directly.", "Primary Dependency Risks": "Availability, pricing, and policies of