s (bonus/thresholds per asset, governance/risk-managed) (aave.com) Onchain liquidations when collateral value breaches borrow limits; liquidators repay debt for collateral at protocol-defined incentives Onchain liquidation via auctions (debt, collateral, surplus); keeper participation required Health Factor-based liquidations (HF < 1), onchain seizure/repay mechanics (Spark Docs) Standard liquidation when LTV exceeds LLTV; liquidators repay debt and seize collateral at discount (protocol-enforced) (docs.morpho.org)": "Stability Pool absorbs liquidations by burning LUSD to repay liquidated debt and receiving collateral (ETH) — primary liquidation path (Liquity Docs)", "Maintaining Organization Aave DAO (governance) + Aave Labs (major dev & interface/operator tooling) (aave.com) Compound DAO (governance) with historical development by Compound Labs MakerDAO (DAO-governed protocol) with core units / contributors maintaining modules Spark Governance (SPK) operating via the Spark Agent in the Sky Atlas (Sky ecosystem) (Spark Docs) Morpho Governance (MORPHO token); governance whitelists IRMs/LLTVs and can activate fee switch (docs.morpho.org)": "Immutable protocol (no governance parameter control); Liquity team maintains docs, integrations, and ecosystem communications (Liquity)", "Oracle Dependencies Primarily Chainlink price feeds with protocol risk controls (market-config dependent) Chainlink price feeds (primary), with protocol-defined fallbacks/guards Decentralized Oracle Network (Maker Oracles) with Chainlink integrations and redundancy Oracle-driven risk system; Spark has integrated oracle providers (e.g., RedStone) for lending markets (RedStone blog) Oracle per market; Morpho established an oracle wrapper for Chainlink feeds to support initial markets (morpho.org)": "Uses price inputs to enforce collateral ratios and liquidation thresholds (implementation details are protocol-specific; practitioners treat oracle/price feed assumptions as first-order risk) (Liquity